땠니? (안녕하셨니?)","그는 너의 상사였니?","그때는 몇 시였니?","그때는 7시였다.","어제는 날씨가 추웠니?","아니, 어제는 춥지 않았어.","어제는 따뜻했다."],"grammar-en":["I was poor.","He was rich.","You were happy.","She was sad.","We were students.","They were workers.","This was my car.","These were your pencils.","Those were their pens.","My face was red.","It was yours.","This was mine.","Was I safe?","Was he happy?","Was she married?","Were you rich?","Was my face red?","Were they healthy?","What was her maiden name?","Where were you?","Where was I?","Where was he?","Who were you?","What was he?","Was she your girl friend?","Were they your friends?","Were these boys your classmates?","Whose pen was this?","Was she beautiful?","Was this pen yours?","Were these yours?","Was this mine?","Where were they?","Where was she?","Where were we?","How was your mother?","Was he your boss?","What time was it then?","It was seven o'clock.","Was it cold yesterday?","No, it was not cold yesterday.","It was warm yesterday."]},"load":{"navigated":true,"rendered":true,"href":"https://k-ig-core.vercel.app/grammar1/gh1-008","reloads":0},"depth":"full"}
